                    <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-brand-greenDark mb-4">01</div>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Add Your First Leads</h4>
                    <ul class="text-sm text-gray-500 space-y-2 mb-6">
                        <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-brand-greenDark"></i> Step 1: Go to Leads</li>
                        <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-brand-greenDark"></i> Step 2: Add manually or import</li>
                        <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-brand-greenDark"></i> Step 3: Organize with tags</li>
